shelves and hanging from hooks in the ceiling are magical items that look as 
if they don't work and probably never did.  A few newer items also clutter the 
place, maybe some new magical experiments.  In the northeast corner is a 
contraption which might be the secret 'Mobile Launcher' Digger has been 
designing.
~
